 "hints": [
  "With an un-bypassed emitter resistor the gain is about R_C / (R_E + r_e).",
  "r_e = 25.85 mV / I_C, about 18 ohm at 1.46 mA, so the emitter side is about 218 ohm.",
  "For a gain of 10, R_C is about 10 x 218 ohm. 20 dB = 20 log10(10)."
 ]
